---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Life Drawing Supplies" mainClass="page-content-text">
  <article class="post">
    <h2>Life drawing supplies</h2>

    <br />
    <p><strong>14x17" or 18x24" sketch pad</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>50-60 lb paper works well.</li>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.dickblick.com/items/strathmore-300-series-sketch-pad-18-x-24-wire-bound-30-sheets/">Strathmore 300 Series Sketch Pad</a></li>
    </ul>

    <br />
    <p><strong>A board big enough to hold your sketch pad</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Any board that won't bend will do. Masonite is a common choice.</li>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.dickblick.com/items/blick-sketch-pad-board-23-12-x-26/">Blick Sketch Pad Board</a></li>
    </ul>

    <br />
    <p><strong>3-4 #2 or HB pencils</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Ticonderoga-Pencils-Pre-Sharpened-Yellow-Barrel/dp/B000JEAAP2/">Ticonderoga Pencils</a> or <a href="https://www.dickblick.com/items/staedtler-lumograph-pencil-hb/">Staedtler Lumograph Pencil</a></li>
    </ul>

    <br />
    <p><strong>Kneaded eraser</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.dickblick.com/items/blick-kneaded-eraser-large/">Blick Kneaded Eraser</a></li>
    </ul>

    <br />
    <h2>Optional:</h2>

    <br />
    <p><strong>1-2 spring clamps</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.amazon.com/Mr-Spring-Clamps-Inches-Heavy/dp/B097PMPT5X/">Mr. Spring Clamps</a></li>
    </ul>

    <br />
    <p><strong>2-4 large binder clips</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.amazon.com/DSTELIN-1-6Inch-Supplies-0-7Inch-Capacity/dp/B07BPJRCSF/">Spring clamps</a></li>
    </ul>

    <br />
    <p><strong>Pen-style eraser</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Suggested: <a href="https://www.dickblick.com/items/tombow-mono-zero-refillable-eraser-eraser-refill-pack-round/">Tombow Mono-Zero Eraser</a> or <a href="https://www.dickblick.com/items/generals-factis-mechanical-eraser/">Generals Factis Mechanical Eraser</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
